          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.087,
            0.846,
            0.128
          ],
          "content": "？ Simplify the expression to show that we get the same formula for the area of a rhombus in terms of its diagonals."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.148,
            0.29,
