          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Trapezium"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.188,
            0.846,
            0.227
          ],
          "content": "? Find the areas of the following trapeziums by breaking them into figures whose areas can be computed."
